  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Resilience through Evidence and Action on Loss and Damage (REAL) Project in Nepal</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The REAL project tackles climate-induced Loss and Damage (L&amp;D), focusing on both economic and non-economic impacts. It uses evidence-based advocacy to reflect the lived realities of affected communities. Nepal, as an LDC, faces high climate vulnerability. By promoting inclusivity and grassroots engagement, the project amplifies local voices to shape global climate resilience policies.</narrative>
  </description>
